# Hermes answering a real prompt: launch, splash, hand-off, prompt, tool
# cards, streamed answer. Needs a Hermes home with a model (DEMO_HERMES_HOME)
# and a streaming preset; record 60 to 90 seconds for a free model.
#   capture.sh agent-turn 75 agent-turn "What does this project do? Read the code and answer in two sentences."
run "{state}/hermes.sh kerykeion"
wait 5200
type "{arg}"
wait 700
key enter
